@startuml "Use Case Diagram"
left to right direction

Actor Student
Actor Instructor

rectangle "System" {
    "Verify Lecture In Session" as (inSession)
    "Verify Login" as (isUsername)
    "Verify Registration" as (isNotUsername)

    "Log In" as (Login)
    "Register" as (Register)

    "Start Lecture" as (Lecture)

    "Start Transcription" as (Start)
    "End Transcription" as (End)
    "Request Summary" as (Summary)

    "Ask Question" as (Ask)
    "Raise Hand" as (Raise)
}

Instructor -- Lecture
Instructor -- Start
Instructor -- End
Instructor -- Summary
Instructor -- Login
Instructor -- Register

Student -- Summary
Student -- Ask
Student -- Raise
Student -- Login
Instructor -- Register

Start ..> inSession: <<extends>>
Summary ..> inSession : <<extends>>
Raise ..> inSession: <<extends>>
Ask ..> inSession: <<extends>>
Login ..> isUsername: <<extends>>
Register ..> isNotUsername: <<extends>>


@enduml